# Fork additions below. SPDX-License-Identifier: BSD-3-Clause for the entries
# this fork added; the upstream entries above are unchanged and keep upstream's
# own terms. Nothing upstream is removed or reordered to make room.

# Zig build (fork additions, upstream conventions kept above)
