# Nix and devenv (fork additions). `devenv/` is the generated shell state,
# `.direnv/` is what direnv leaves behind, and `result`/`result-*` are the
# symlinks `nix build` and `nix-build` put in this directory.
.direnv/
devenv/
# devenv writes a hidden sibling of its own state directory too.
.devenv/
result
result-*
.nix-build/
